    "sections": {
        "description": "DualTone is a two-column layout blog with sticky sidebar on the left, as a tribute to b2/cafelog, the origins of WordPress more than 21 years ago. It features a full-width page template for legal text, a blank template for flexible layouts, and several custom block style variations. Includes multiple theme styles, a light default and a futuristic dark style. Two block sections have contrast and accent color backgrounds, and a settings page allows customization of block patterns. Works with WordPress 6.7. Playground demo available at: https://playground.wordpress.net/?mode=seamless&amp;blueprint-url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dballari/dualtone-playground-demo/main/demo/blueprint.json"
    },
